        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Quite a coincidence that we&apos;re in the same city! I guess you&apos;re doing a contract here. Which is good, because I ran into some people who I think should be taught a lesson! I will not go into detail on what these two people have done, but I assure you that they deserve it! Oh, and while you&apos;re at it, could you get that army truck near the school for me? I&apos;ll pay you extra for it.\r\rAvoid collateral damage, and good luck to you.",
